        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40882"/>
        <updated>2025-08-25T22:14:33.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #32946.">Fix</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2223516993" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32946" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/32946/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32946">#32946</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">It makes a lot of sense to dedupe between them:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>The pages already duplicate a lot</li>
<li>It more accurately describes the IDL and the real API structure</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">However, BCD cannot be changed because the two interfaces have slightly different support (because XHR landed before the shared <code class="notranslate">XMLHttpRequestEventTarget</code> parent class).</p>]]></content>
